      <h2 id="deploymentconfig-operations" class="group scroll-mt-20">Managing DeploymentConfig objects<a href="#deploymentconfig-operations" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
      <Alert variant="info" class="my-4">
